  "notes": "Modified cash basis village, FYE 9/30/2023. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5); business-type (Utilities Fund) statement lines and balances from the proprietary fund statement (p7; modified cash basis, net position = cash and investments, measure cash as in FY2024). Transfers printed only as a net Total column figure (44,704) out of governmental funds, into the Utilities Fund. Fund balances from p5; ending cash = sum of printed cash lines on p4 (no single cash total printed), investments separate; beginning cash not printed (null). Balance sheet: governmental funds statement (p4, totals equal government-wide p1) plus proprietary fund statement (p6). The only supplementary schedule is the combined all-funds Budgetary Comparison Schedule (p8, unaudited), so detail is per fund column of the governmental and proprietary fund statements (village rule); p8 not recorded. Read pages 1-8 of 8"
